            </button>
            <div id="answer-1" class="mt-4 text-gray-600 hidden overflow-hidden h-0 transition-all duration-300"
              style="height: 0;">
              <p>Pay3 powers the payment rails for the agentic economy. Pay3 provides agentic commerce and instant
                payments solutions leveraging stablecoin rails. </p>
              <p>Pay3 offers stablecoin payment infrastructure, agentic AI payments, cross-border settlement, local
                payment acceptance, and global treasury management. </p>
              <p>Businesses can accept, send, and settle payments across 100+ stablecoins and digital assets, 30+
                blockchains, 300+ local payment methods across 100+ countries. </p>
            </div>
          </div>
