                  <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M5 10a1 1 0 011-1h8a1 1 0 110 2H6a1 1 0 01-1-1z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
                </svg>
              </div>
            </button>
            <div id="answer-2" class="mt-4 text-gray-600 hidden overflow-hidden h-0 transition-all duration-300"
              style="height: 0;">
              <p>Pay3 supports a wide range of stablecoin and agentic payment use cases, including <strong>agentic
                  commerce,
                  e-commerce checkouts, cross-border payments, global treasury operations, trading and brokerage
                  platforms, remittances, invoice payments, subscription payments, payroll and in-game
                  transactions</strong> across
                global digital ecosystems.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <!-- FAQ Item 3 -->
          <div class="bg-gray-100 rounded-lg p-6">
            <button class="w-full text-left flex justify-between items-center" onclick="toggleFAQ(3)">
              <h3 class="text-[18px] lg:text-[22px] font-medium text-gray-800">
                What is agentic commerce and how does Pay3 handle autonomous payments?
              </h3>
              <div class="flex-shrink-0">
                <!-- Plus Icon -->
                <svg id="icon-plus-3" class="w-6 h-6 text-gray-500" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
                  <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 5a1 1 0 011 1v8a1 1 0 11-2 0V6a1 1 0 011-1z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
                  <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M5 10a1 1 0 011-1h8a1 1 0 110 2H6a1 1 0 01-1-1z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
                </svg>
                <!-- Minus Icon -->
                <svg id="icon-minus-3" class="w-6 h-6 text-gray-500 hidden" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
                  <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M5 10a1 1 0 011-1h8a1 1 0 110 2H6a1 1 0 01-1-1z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
                </svg>
              </div>
            </button>
            <div id="answer-3" class="mt-4 text-gray-600 hidden overflow-hidden h-0 transition-all duration-300"
              style="height: 0;">
              <p>Agentic commerce refers to AI agents autonomously discovering, deciding, and executing transactions on
                behalf of users or businesses. These agents can complete actions such as purchasing products, paying for
                APIs, managing subscriptions, or executing business workflows based on predefined conditions and
                user-approved mandates.</p>
              <p>Pay3 provides the payment infrastructure layer for these autonomous transactions through secure,
                intent-bound, and policy-controlled payments. Its platform enables AI agents to transact using
                stablecoin rails with programmable spending controls, global settlement capabilities, and transparent
                audit trails for safe and scalable agent-driven commerce.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <!-- FAQ Item 4 -->
          <div class="bg-gray-100 rounded-lg p-6">
            <button class="w-full text-left flex justify-between items-center" onclick="toggleFAQ(4)">
              <h3 class="text-[18px] lg:text-[22px] font-medium text-gray-800">
                Which digital assets, blockchains are supported?
              </h3>
              <div class="flex-shrink-0">
                <!-- Plus Icon -->
                <svg id="icon-plus-4" class="w-6 h-6 text-gray-500" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
                  <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 5a1 1 0 011 1v8a1 1 0 11-2 0V6a1 1 0 011-1z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
                  <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M5 10a1 1 0 011-1h8a1 1 0 110 2H6a1 1 0 01-1-1z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
                </svg>
