                  <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M5 10a1 1 0 011-1h8a1 1 0 110 2H6a1 1 0 01-1-1z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
                </svg>
              </div>
            </button>
            <div id="answer-4" class="mt-4 text-gray-600 hidden overflow-hidden h-0 transition-all duration-300"
              style="height: 0;">
              <p>Pay3 supports 100+ digital assets and stablecoins across 30+ major blockchain networks. Supported
                Layer-1 chains include Bitcoin, Ethereum, Solana, BNB Chain, Tron, and others, while supported Layer-2
                networks include Arbitrum, Polygon, Base, Lightning Network, and more.This broad coverage enables
                businesses to accept, move and settle digital assets across the most widely used blockchain ecosystems
