            <div id="answer-6" class="mt-4 text-gray-600 hidden overflow-hidden h-0 transition-all duration-300"
              style="height: 0;">
              <p>Getting started with Pay3 is streamlined to reduce time-to-live deployment down to days. The
                onboarding experience consists of a swift compliance review, developer portal setup, sandbox API
